2 CONT * Death:	May 2 1880
2 CONT * Parents:	Abraham Gustaf Falkengren, Eva Eleanora Falkengren (born Lindencrona)
2 CONT * Wife:	Falkenberg (born Centervall)
2 CONT * Siblings:	Gustafva Eleonora Amalia Falkengren, Gustaf Adolf Falkengreen, Per Christoffer Falkengreen, Eva Ulrica Falkengren, Ingeborg Christina Hultberg, Eleonora Gustafva Falkengren, Ebba Constantia Margareta Falkengren
