2 CONT * Barn:	Jacob Ekerman, Anna Ekerman, Anders Nilsson Ekerman, Elisabeth Nilsdotter Knutsson (born Ekerman), Paulus Nicolai Ekerman, Johannes Ekerman, Agneta Ekerman, Isak Ekerman, Bengt Nilsson Ekerman, Daniel Eckerman
