1 NAME Johan Herman /Wikblad/
2 GIVN Johan Herman
2 SURN Wikblad
2 _MARNM Wikblad
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 31 MAR 1817
2 ADDR
3 STAE (E)
