1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Modern sägs visserligen vara Anna* Sophia Bohlia, fast hennes ålder, 46 år, då Anna föddes talar emot detta, så jag lämnar moderskapet öppet, tills vidare. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Christina Follin, born Ekeroth, was the daughter of kyrkoherde (parish priest) Elias Ekeroth in Bankekinds socken. She married Samuel Follin on September 22, 17431. Samuel Follin, in turn, was a Swedish priest and author. He 
2 CONC was born on October 8, 1746, in Bankekinds socken and passed away on December 18, 1819, in Helsingborg. Elias Follin studied at Uppsala University and held various positions, including hovpredikant (court preacher) and kyrkoherde 
2 CONC (parish priest) in different locations
2 CONT
