1 CONC å att i Ålberga ström uppföra ett s.k. snidverk (för beredning av ämnesjärn) samttråddrageri, och i samma brev omtalas deras avsikt att "därsammastädes och på andra orter, där de sina bruk och verk har, fournera och införa allehan
1 CONC da slags manufakturer, såsom av spiksmideri och andra sorter järn". - Ett rätt stort antal brev avde Besche till Louis De Geer tillika som andra handlingar rörande de Besche finns i Lövstaarkivet och ha tack vare riksbibliotekarie
1 CONC n E. V. Dahlgrens förmedling kunnat utnyttjas. Brev och inlagor från de Besche finns även i bergskollegiets brevoch suppliker. 
0 @N6000000006127417585@ NOTE Introducerad 1625 med namnet Cruus af Harfvila under nr 2 i gamla riddarklassen, emedan han var son av ett riksråd. Axel Mattsson uppges enligt EÄ, död omkring 1630. 
0 @N6000000002577276247@ NOTE !SOURCE:
1 CONT 1- 14 Aug 1993: Data from the records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 2- 26 Oct 1994: TempleReady report.
1 CONT 3- Swedish Postal Address Book: Stake Family History Center.
1 CONT 4- 1 August 1996: Ancestral File report.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- 1996: We have no data on Jon Raal so will add what was on this report.
1 CONT 2- The name of the locality is listed in the Ancestral File report as
1 CONT "Stralsnes, Asbo". This name is not found in the postal book, but the parish
1 CONT and county of Asby, Ostergotland, is. "Asbo" must be a typo.
0 @N6000000002577276206@ NOTE !SOURCE:
1 CONT 1- 1993: From the records of Owen B Anderson and A R Anderson.
1 CONT 2- 31 May 1994: TempleReady file report.
1 CONT 3- July 1994: Swedish Postal listing; Micro-fische;Family Search.
1 CONT
1 CONT NOTE:
1 CONT 1- 14 Aug 1993: The records of Owen B Anderson had a more compleate birthplace.
1 CONT It also has the surname as RAAF.
1 CONT 2- The place of death is listed as "of Hokefors,,Smaland,Sweden. Other
1 CONT family locality names use Tuna, Kalmar, as the parish and county.
1 CONT 3- October 1994: The Swedish Postal Address book has the place name of
1 CONT "Hokefore" listed as "Hokfore", with 2 dots over the 1st o. If Smaland
1 CONT is the provence of birth, then the address is Tuna parish, Kalmar county.
1 CONT 4- 1996: This report had the birthplace as Stralsnas, Asbo, Ostergotland,
1 CONT Sweden. This will have to be verified at another time. Also this report
1 CONT listed her death as 27 Mar 1738.
